# C++ Syntax Cheat Sheet

## Header Files

```cpp
#include <iostream>
#include <string>
#include <fstream>
using namespace std;
```

---

## Basic Program

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int main()
{
    return 0;
}
```

---

## Output

```cpp
cout << "Hello";
cout << variable;
cout << "Age: " << age;
cout << endl;
cout << "\n";
```

---

## Input

```cpp
cin >> variable;
getline(cin, variable);
```

---

## Variables

```cpp
int age = 18;
float pi = 3.14;
double salary = 25000.50;
char grade = 'A';
bool flag = true;
string name = "Rajat";
const float PI = 3.14159;
```

